{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "b89fede8cc46fed93e0ed799e46befb962801c4c7af62524ca6c596e0ad0fa86", "ja": "打ち上げはカーニバル！", "zh": "庆功宴是嘉年华！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1e5965e6cc5e2186e45bacfe7c88eb2d442458cec9aea40d1242e7fd8c093281", "ja": "無事に公演を終えたARRIVE。可憐の提案で\nサンバカーニバルに遊びに行くことに。\n活動を振り返って、可憐や莉緒はプロデュー\nサーへの感謝の言葉を口にする。ARRIVEの\n今後の活躍に期待しつつ、みんなでサンバ！", "zh": "『ARRIVE』的公演平安结束，一行人接受可怜的\n提议，来到森巴嘉年华游玩。可怜和莉绪回顾\n这次活动，并说出了心中对制作人的感谢。\n除了期待着『ARRIVE』今后的活跃，也和大家\n一起享受森巴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38f48d20ca1bf4d1fa9a84b05f7af060afe3229ba32a9712fc265075b4892c77", "ja": "（団結したメンバー達の努力が実を結び、\nARRIVEの公演は無事に終わった……）", "zh": "（成员团结一心，她们的努力也开花结果，\n『ARRIVE』的公演顺利落幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1001_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "1ba7d9732adf8192899d59aa39f559a772e8249f2b7028ce4aa86c99e61e718b", "ja": "見て見て！　サンバカーニバルだヨっ♪\nう～、体がうずく～！", "zh": "你们看你们看！是森巴嘉年华喔♪\n呜～身体蠢蠢欲动～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "6c87102df7207e2be36f2071bc9857dc1aebedc5564cca5f8f9cdb0b538df66c", "ja": "えへへ。ライブ成功のお祝いに……何かないかと\n思って、さ、探してみたんです……そしたら……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我想着要怎么庆祝……演唱会成功，\n就查了一下……然后……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "453a549c469d229f8f352698d14a024a0bd6c1cb5d259621359cd0185019c7a9", "ja": "サンバカーニバルを見つけた、ってワケね。\nウフフ、特にエレナちゃんにはうってつけだわ♪", "zh": "就找到了森巴嘉年华对吧，\n呵呵，尤其是特别适合艾琳娜呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "2686815443731e214479dc6735315fb09ffd4bc8297bb26433def02320f16ef8", "ja": "ぶらじるの伝統芸能……情熱的で、胸躍る光景です。\nそれにあの衣装、芸術的な趣がありませんか。みちこ。", "zh": "巴西的传统艺能……这副光景既热情、也令人雀跃。\n且服装十分有艺术感呢，路子（MICHICO）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "181bf52e774feb7514207515d0de9a4469f313c64d3656d739b4b7f6ebe37277", "ja": "はい！　インスピレーションが刺激されます♪\n……あと、みちこじゃなくて、ロコです～！", "zh": "是的！激发了ROCO的Inspiration♪\n……还有，不是MICHICO，是ROCO～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e7f339968905eda895d87bc4d855799f1f684409c3d3811d4469c5b8fee75152", "ja": "みんな、屋台で買い物してきたらどうだ？　今日は\nライブのご褒美だ、好きなものを買っていいぞ！", "zh": "大家要不要去摊贩买点东西？今天要犒赏你们在\n演唱会上的表现，可以买自己喜欢的东西喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "27fc7ec4a48df54e175b28e1d9e4c6778ea1443a77601deb7da2aa9f46e9f35e", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとネっ♪\nねえねえ、リオっ、一緒に回ろっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢啰♪\n欸欸，莉绪，我们一起去逛吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "6fe6da1eefdb03f9d56fa7c9f353a54de60ff98cc6ec0878998c3b45eb9d7b6c", "ja": "こらこら、走らなくても屋台は逃げないわよ？\nエレナちゃんたら、ホント元気なんだから。", "zh": "等等，你别急啊，摊贩又不会跑掉。\n艾琳娜真是太有活力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "15e88b207733f29d79bbd6f62905a22d49784c5fc4e55a03b465ddc2428d2677", "ja": "なんと……焼きらーめん、なる看板が見えます。\nこれは、とても心惹かれますね。", "zh": "竟然……看见了写着「炒拉面」的看板。\n这十分吸引人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "e177ea2874b07ceeb2fc072c3148e6f9f0217757673dafb223823f4975b53e27", "ja": "あれは……シューティングの屋台！　ロコのアーティス\nティックなテクニックで、景品をゲットしてきます♪", "zh": "那是……Shooting的摊位！ROCO要用\nArtistic的Technique来Get奖品♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e22a814bc06f10cffe9487f1522d17c6d929d3fba9bde3240bc2507132df566", "ja": "あはは、みんな元気だな。\n……あれ、可憐は行かないのか？", "zh": "哈哈，大家可真有活力。\n……奇怪，可怜你不去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "8149d45b294b6a2cc9d8be501339b7589f96bd1e7ee8cf69425c997a4ae1bde7", "ja": "あ……は、はい……行きます、けど。\nその前に……えっと……。", "zh": "啊……是、是的……我会去，但是，\n在那之前……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "7f8f6d762d6021a800b0ce79720d5964e0c7d969459f26d5ca31886ce4dbd099", "ja": "{$P$}さんに……。\nその……お、お礼がっ……言いたくて……。", "zh": "那个……我、我想向……\n{$P$}先生……道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fcc243dc46b08d87165f70cc82cb9a6640db6fc708541af62735645022388912", "ja": "お礼？　何のだ？", "zh": "道谢？谢什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "81a20c9b1f45f910ae7ed4a218c1f6ec680a81d5e3cf296c657edb577333a906", "ja": "私を、あ、ARRIVEに入れてくれて……リーダーを\n任せてくれて……ありがとう、ございました……！", "zh": "你让我加入A、『ARRIVE』……还让我担任队长……\n非常感谢你……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "e8ae3d4476d1aa934ff07df8f69d5e7379ac7917850c1228a85219b406be800b", "ja": "い、いろんなことがあって、大変でしたけど……。\nでも……それ以上に、楽しかったんです……。", "zh": "虽、虽然发生了很多事，很辛苦……\n但……快乐的时候更多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "dda184fe6e9c390008653133cf8813aa813f7ea1eb7d69fb0994dff1dd875dc5", "ja": "こんな私でも、みんなの役に立ててるって……\nじ、実感すると、ちょっぴり、自信にもなって……。", "zh": "连这样的自己也能帮上大家的忙……\n我、我体会到了这些，增加了一点点自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ab758361f7a4938bf2fbe71f95a6b34d254d54a918d232134c3bb0654e59ab57", "ja": "可憐……。", "zh": "可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "580ae0a6eee2ce4710c3f93b499f7c448a957f5667b38de4b79d3d5ac3dc471c", "ja": "ほんの少し……成長、できたかもって……\n{$P$}さんのおかげ、だから……。", "zh": "可能有一点点……小小的成长吧……\n这是多亏了{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "e51688ff4cbc6060a1824bb852f11ec6cc8e3dd9efff5e0b0ec9c15c4ae52565", "ja": "こ、これからもっ、私のプロデュース……\nよろしくお願いしますっ……！", "zh": "以、以后也请你……\n继续培育我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c5e91ed485ff8aaacf37ecea3f7b1e2ece74ac99abb0adf3b28748349ed3c498", "ja": "（お礼を言うだけ言って、走り去ってしまった……）", "zh": "（只道完谢就跑走了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "99839fa9939427e90867576ac430e6f2b1787d9a426149b302f2b486aaa40902", "ja": "（でも、可憐の成長に繫がって本当によかった。\nこの経験は、今後に生きてくるだろう……）", "zh": "（但能让可怜有所成长真是太好了，\n这份经验也会在未来派上用场吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "17d0d014ff832e88f67e83c416957ffe3f4f3330091a9a0d3ce5924a91ae8579", "ja": "なんか今、可憐ちゃんが走っていったけど……。\nまさか、変なコトしたんじゃないでしょうねぇ～？", "zh": "刚刚可怜好像跑走了……\n你该不会对她做了什么奇怪的事吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "59f276facd1340fb880f407e1e4e5049f49d2525c6480d385fafa4d347c64c68", "ja": "何を言ってるんだか……。可憐が、\nリーダーをやれてよかったって言ってくれただけだよ。", "zh": "你在说什么啊……可怜只是对我说\n她很庆幸能当队长而已喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "1c1152ee3d7f28f88cd4dd2b53eccb26305d1c1c92fbacd6d671a8ba239201cb", "ja": "あー、お礼を言うのが照れくさかったワケね。\nウフフ、その気持ち、ちょっとわかるかも♪", "zh": "啊～是因为向人道谢会害羞呀。\n呵呵，我好像也有点懂那个心情♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "47af90f6bcd3b1244c9929f7dee1978cff688e0e985a49ca8eae2c6c51855191", "ja": "……ね、{$P$}くん。\nそこに座って、一杯やらない？", "zh": "……欸，{$P$}，\n要不要到那边坐着喝一杯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c18cd2bb77bec384565c3d9ed0f754ad74804d61597181911fb3187dc7f2e0c4", "ja": "今日は俺、みんなの引率なんだけど……。", "zh": "但今天我要负责领队……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "433094073bdc36c4900ec3c6113d07dc2b76a57ad4f9d4c9160d744515710261", "ja": "すこしくらいなら大丈夫よ♪\nはい、大人の麦茶。カンパーイ♪", "zh": "只喝一点没关系的啦♪\n来，大人的麦茶，干杯～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "30a0348191429640c1ef25d2d2a6e297d91378fd14255df87c60478f7b253a5c", "ja": "今回はホント、いろいろ心配かけちゃってごめんね？\nあんな姿見せて、情けないやら恥ずかしいやら……。", "zh": "这次真的让你们操了很多心，不好意思啰。\n让你看到我那个样子，该说是丢脸还是难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "26afeec84ffc8fe54d8ba1fb2f4645cb7de0091812ecd656dc1c1a0ceb6d82fb", "ja": "気にすることないと思うけど……。\nむしろ俺がもっと早く気付くべきだったしな。", "zh": "我觉得不用太介意啊……\n反而是我该早点发现的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "578617a43a949a9b6d41a69a14dd673aa502ac7bd3ad67b499e4029b5a6a9cc9", "ja": "あはっ、{$P$}くんったら。\nホント優しいんだから。", "zh": "啊哈，{$P$}，\n你实在是太温柔了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "74c00e6e6cc4ca81545ddcefad936eef5eef7c26948065e87452522fa5d74887", "ja": "……あ、そうそう！　そういえば聞いてよ！\nあの子がね、今回のライブを見に来てくれてたの♪", "zh": "……啊，对了对了！你听我说！\n那孩子也来看这次的演唱会了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a29e0a2ed3a01715c454bb3407b4f0cf30439817b3e52dc01b00e4e68759d647", "ja": "あの子？", "zh": "那孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "a440f2b565c2087d562e2a6b4b8aca65748486d29da95a99b3e3d2fbb1da2a43", "ja": "前にイベントで、私が手を振ったら逃げちゃった子！\n最前列で、私の色のライトを振ってくれてたのよ！", "zh": "之前活动上，看到我挥手就跑掉的男生！\n他在最前排，挥着我的代表色的萤光棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "289771b056b0c69eca3068b2da00131a17fa0b58b93b6660c613cd323cc41352", "ja": "ライブの後に、手紙までもらっちゃってね！\nねえねえ、なんて書いてあったと思う！？", "zh": "演唱会之后我还收到了信喔！\n欸欸，你猜他写了什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1039_p", "source_sha256": "7f55ecbdcb5cc9d1327989d613ce564f77d7224ae35ab0d541772bd60ce53446", "ja": "さ、さあ……？", "zh": "写、写什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "8f7c40dbe717bdfb5ea703ab47bfb6fe2a4381624192bde7038024d7be9ab47c", "ja": "「逃げちゃってごめんなさい。綺麗すぎて、\n顔が見られなかったんです」……って！", "zh": "「对不起之前逃走了，因为你太漂亮了，\n没办法直视你的脸。」……他这样写！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "36e8495cd78d14da1f55ae1f3ba8f1a29b0f6e3ea3e771b6d0f47ffbae9058f6", "ja": "綺麗すぎて、よ！？　{$P$}くん！\nどうする！？　私ってば、もしかしてモテ期！？", "zh": "他说我太漂亮了喔！？{$P$}！\n怎么办！？我现在是桃花期吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "4ad287f74f6148f1a1259cafa556dbe4d069214f5c5ab0298ade955195fe092b", "ja": "う、嬉しいのはわかるけど、落ち着こう。\n相手はファンの子だぞ。", "zh": "我、我知道你很开心，但先冷静，\n对方可是粉丝啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "4888e5798937d78258210b3b725a68fc976006430f46346cd4530503249458ef", "ja": "でも、やっぱり莉緒のファンだったんだな。\nそんなことじゃないかと思ったよ。", "zh": "但他果然是莉绪的粉丝呢，\n我就在想是不是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1044_046rio", "source_sha256": "9167a2a374eda416d8647bcccfeaa4c49a8d67324ae16beb5094a1cc37e5f229", "ja": "フフッ、お姉さんをカン違いさせるなんて……。\n罪なボウヤなんだから♪", "zh": "呵呵，竟然让大姊姊误会了……\n真是个罪孽深重的男孩♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1045_p", "source_sha256": "33dca906c78440392a65a16b8aa39722190e6aa0cb4e9d8dbdd05ab636c868bf", "ja": "（そうなのか？）", "zh": "（是这样吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "a1f76672f50e19878a1c3f1bdeb8229057a59b0afbb8aadd7b217ccfe429c4ec", "ja": "……ねえ、{$P$}くん。\n私、もっと頑張るわ。", "zh": "……欸，{$P$}。\n我会更加努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "e1ff47b6d2be066906359440725bd929b8624bef31b70420dd20d708492c5776", "ja": "{$P$}くんにも、私の……\n大事なファンの子達にも、胸を張れるように。", "zh": "为了让{$P$}，还有……\n我重要的粉丝们，能够以我为傲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1048_p", "source_sha256": "ed14f5e0c5fab7ddd1cb82d75465e79846e60314c51bdd6b25c73a9605b059f2", "ja": "……ああ。莉緒が頑張り続ける限り、\n俺も全力で莉緒をプロデュースするよ。", "zh": "……嗯，只要莉绪你持续努力下去，\n我就会尽全力培育你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "3b79d8bde493721098f099c5c70f87b8bc4fdcb608f481c3dc81387315b8a815", "ja": "うん。ありがと♪", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1050_045kar", "source_sha256": "9d6c843c1159c968ddf2667487c6542a8c4c6d95454b90d7419b2b6f03712266", "ja": "え、エレナさん……！\nあ、あの……私、まだ心の準備が……！", "zh": "艾、艾琳娜……！\n那、那个……我还没做好心理准备……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1051_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c235b077c9e62affd5741d38b3ba2a4c8d78afe4b58fbf65e085a64e7d4c110", "ja": "サンバの行列は目の前だヨ～！\nホラホラ、ダンサーさん達が手招きしてるっ♪", "zh": "森巴游行就在眼前喔～！\n好了好了，舞者们已经在招手了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1052_008tak", "source_sha256": "fccd5dae1243d746a8eda27759c4c0ffd3224ddd71b7a97f28393b809023e047", "ja": "食後の運動に、ちょうどよいかもしれません。\n島原エレナ。さんばの手ほどき、お願いいたします。", "zh": "也许这做为饭后运动正好。\n岛原艾琳娜，拜托你指导小女子跳森巴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1053_025roc", "source_sha256": "56c293b3ac985a29c4d1391577bd73f9c82713bf400e87ac850b2fdfcb919c06", "ja": "ロコもサンバのリズムをラーニングしたいです！\n新しいアートの予感です！", "zh": "ROCO也想Learning森巴的Rhythm！\n有新的Art的预感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1054_018ele", "source_sha256": "71a89a4bdc1f03bd1613614ff2f5d7aa16d53cf271a31ec19184f12741127171", "ja": "もちろんだヨー！　サンバはフリとか、気にしなくて\nいいノ！　みんなで楽しもうネっ♪", "zh": "这是当然的喔～！森巴不用介意动作之类的！\n大家一起享受吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1055_018ele", "source_sha256": "0811f348fcd104bf3be7e4672d8d48cce9e8bc0be82323a0334c4e53d41df475", "ja": "あ！　リオー！　{$P$}！\nふたりもこっちにおいでヨー。一緒に踊ろっ！", "zh": "啊！莉绪！{$P$}！\n你们也过来嘛～一起跳舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1056_046rio", "source_sha256": "e7091edd058270ef8cc455155016b3e46d27139fe8d3d6d8b770ec5afc045f0a", "ja": "ウフフッ。\nエレナちゃんってば、ホントに元気なんだから。", "zh": "呵呵，\n艾琳娜真是太有活力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1057_046rio", "source_sha256": "db2a9d320cc0b9ce5a20b364f44908b5623bd68f65e75a5d8c8842546e74cbde", "ja": "オッケー、すぐに行くわ！\nサンバでも負けないんだから、覚悟しなさい！", "zh": "OK，马上过去！\n森巴我也不会输给你的，做好觉悟吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1058_018ele", "source_sha256": "d3c10bc0ffaa73f5167bb8ca2123750dd58fc0e34feb4bc1f79ee69d8dadc8cf", "ja": "エヘヘっ、やる気まんまんだネっ！\nワタシも負けないヨー！", "zh": "嘿嘿，真有干劲呢！\n我也不会输喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1059_046rio", "source_sha256": "ad82018e2614d8ae75c5abfdb5394b8260cbd557a0cafad40e6631e8c4fe192f", "ja": "ほらほら、{$P$}くんも！\n行くわよ！", "zh": "快点快点，{$P$}也是！\n要走啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1060_p", "source_sha256": "36715a0db82dfed3cebfb77240a999689b9a75e47453710dab9c549718e0684c", "ja": "ああ！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1061_p", "source_sha256": "4d12b28e402dbcde440391c9793810f6570e87f7644c69a38eea7148f7ec1397", "ja": "（ARRIVE……最初は個性的なメンバーばかりだと\n思ったけど、いいユニットになったじゃないか）", "zh": "（『ARRIVE』……虽然一开始觉得成员的个人风格\n过于强烈，但也成为了一个很棒的团体。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0012_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_07_1062_p", "source_sha256": "fd369e39404e68ae21c1f9015192ac8f49bf5c525b907893cce54567a1c69aca", "ja": "（これからも彼女達が全力で輝けるように、俺も……。\nひとまず、踊るとするか！）", "zh": "（为了让她们未来也能尽全力发光发热……\n我也来跳个舞吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
